1
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,040
Stop it

2
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,000
Nanny Qin

3
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,400
What are you doing

4
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:52,400
The wind is picking up

5
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,120
Close the door

6
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:59,320
Don't let the dust offend the princess consort's eyes

7
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,400
Join me for the meal

8
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:29,720
The rules in the princess consort's residence

9
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:31,600
Servants cannot dine with their masters

10
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,200
You're putting us in an awkward position

11
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:34,800
If anyone asks

12
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,200
Just say I ordered you to

13
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:39,920
Yes

14
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,760
The food isn't poisoned

15
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:54,680
Seems she's truly been tamed by Zhu Huaijin

16
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,160
In that case

17
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:59,480
Why shouldn't I make Zhu Huaijin work for me

18
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:25,560
Why is he here

19
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,320
Who

20
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,120
Madam

21
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,160
It's me

22
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:36,320
Zhi'an, you look absolutely stunning today

23
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:42,400
I need to find an excuse to get out of here

24
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:46,280
My lord, I'm feeling rather tired

25
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,520
I'd like to retire for the night

26
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,240
Zhi'an

27
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:58,800
My chamber is yours as well

28
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:00,680
My lord

29
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:04,280
I'm not feeling well today

30
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,120
That's alright

31
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:13,280
Third Prince

32
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:13,720
Third Prince

33
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,280
I have urgent matters to report

34
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:22,600
I'll be right back

35
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,280
Third Prince

36
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,400
There's a message from the Western Envoy

37
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:50,000
The Western Envoy and the Li family army are his greatest support

38
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,920
Zhu Huaichen's plan is already unfolding

39
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:55,320
I'll dismantle it piece by piece

40
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:56,640
Princess Nanliang Jinghe

41
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,800
Nearly married my uncle General Xiao

42
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:01,720
They have a special method of communication

43
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:05,520
Finding her will surely lead us to the remnants of the Li family

44
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:26,720
Your Highness

45
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,760
Do you know Princess Jinghe?

46
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:35,600
Does she have any connections with our residence?

47
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:39,240
Princess Jinghe

48
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,440
Has no dealings with the prince's residence

49
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:44,040
But the princess is a great philanthropist

50
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,360
On the seventh day of each month

51
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:48,520
She provides relief to injured and sick refugees at the marketplace

52
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,000
The seventh

53
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,040
Isn't that tomorrow?

54
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:56,760
Your Highness, I'll return to the North Courtyard to prepare first

55
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:57,880
Then come back to escort you

56
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,480
Hmm

57
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,680
Marketplace

58
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:08,720
The Li family army has already entered Nanliang territory

59
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:11,160
What if the princess refuses to help?

60
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:14,560
Then I'll post these secret symbols throughout the streets

61
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:17,560
Which might give the Li family army a chance to see them

62
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,000
Please be charitable, young lady

63
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,840
What brings you out for a stroll today?

64
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:32,680
I just arrived in Nanliang

65
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:35,120
I wanted you to accompany me for a walk around

66
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,120
Give me some food

67
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:40,840
Nanliang and Beijin have been at war for years

68
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,000
The people live in misery

69
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:44,520
Even Nanliang territory has deteriorated to this extent

70
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,960
No wonder they proposed a truce

71
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,200
And sent a hostage prince

72
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:49,960
Have mercy, please

73
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:52,960
What's wrong?

74
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:56,000
These are refugees and beggars fleeing the border

75
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:58,400
Nanliang and Beijin have been fighting for many years

76
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,640
The common people suffer terribly

77
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:14,960
This should be Princess Jinghe's free clinic

78
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:19,000
Husband, could you take me to see Princess Jinghe?

79
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,280
Alright

80
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,040
Come this way

81
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:24,000
Let's go

82
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,160
Be careful

83
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,160
Everyone, disperse quickly!

84
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,280
This person might have a contagious disease

85
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:35,080
This needs to be handled separately

86
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:36,520
Didn't you hear what the princess said?

87
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,360
Disperse immediately

88
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,120
Quick, disperse now

89
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,080
This is no place to linger

90
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:40,520
Let's get out of here

91
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:42,880
Zhi'an

92
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:44,080
This happened so suddenly

93
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,960
We'll have to visit Princess Jinghe another day

94
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:50,720
Now we can only rely on the Li family's secret sigil

95
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,000
Zhi'an

96
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:52,720
Are you alright?

97
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,520
Although I'm not familiar with this place

98
00:06:57,880 --> 00:07:00,640
The refugees here seem no different from those in Northern Jin

99
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:02,440
All equally tragic

100
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,720
Are you homesick?

101
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,440
Of course I am

102
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:13,280
But when I remember that as the daughter of a Northern Jin general

103
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,680
After marrying into Southern Liang

104
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,400
Our two countries have found peace

105
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:19,640
What does my little sorrow matter then?

106
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:24,560
I truly believed that was the case

107
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:28,720
Never imagined it was all Zhu Huaichen's scheme

108
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:33,760
My lord

109
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:36,000
This is Northern Jin's protective charm

110
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:38,600
Would you help me hang these around

111
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:42,520
To pray for the people and soldiers of Nanliang and Northern Jin

112
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,920
May war never rise again

113
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,760
Agreed

114
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:45,160
Zhi'an, may I have this last protective charm?

115
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,400
You're of royal blood

116
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,520
Blessed with abundant fortune

117
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:49,560
Why would you need it?

118
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,520
Everyone under heaven has one

119
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,080
Except me

120
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,800
Playing Zhu Huaichen's role

121
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,920
You're quite immersed in the act

122
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:04,080
You're compassionate and kind

123
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,920
While I'm petty and selfish

124
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,600
I'll go hang it up now

125
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,160
Wait

126
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,840
Keep it if you wish

127
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:18,720
I just think these hastily made talismans are rather crude

128
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:21,040
Not worthy of your affection

129
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:30,200
Whatever you give me is the best

130
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:44,760
What?

131
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,440
Every single one is gone

132
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,200
Yes, Your Highness

133
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:50,680
Oh no

134
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:53,000
Could it be that Zhu Huaijin discovered something?

135
00:09:58,920 --> 00:10:00,600
All the talisman papers have disappeared

136
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:04,440
It seems Zhu Huaijin was just acting with me during the day

137
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,280
Kept saying how much he cared about me

138
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,440
But in the end, he still suspects me

139
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:19,720
Has my husband returned?

140
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,000
It's me

141
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,440
Let me help you undress

142
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:25,040
No need

143
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:26,560
I can do it myself

144
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:30,160
Is something troubling you, my husband?

145
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:34,080
Nothing, I just don't want you to overexert yourself

146
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,000
How could I?

147
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:49,800
The protective charm you gave me today has such a unique design

148
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:52,240
I've never seen anything like this even when I was in Beijin

149
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:56,760
Different families have slightly different designs for their protective talismans

150
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:58,440
What's wrong?

151
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:00,760
Don't you like it, my lord?

152
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:02,760
How could I not like something you gave me?

153
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:07,240
You wish for my health and safety year after year

154
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,320
No one has ever blessed me like this before

155
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,080
It will surely protect me

156
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,720
Since you took the protective talisman I hung at the market

157
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:18,200
How could it just be

158
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,520
settled with a few simple words?

159
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:21,480
He must be testing me

160
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:25,200
My lord always says such embarrassing things

161
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:34,840
It's getting late

162
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,920
You should rest early

163
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,680
I still have some official matters to attend to

164
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:53,040
Perfect timing - I also have some important business to handle

165
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:17,240
I recall this was about the time Zhu Huaichen started

166
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:18,920
secretly associating with foreign powers

167
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,120
If we could find

168
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:22,160
his treasonous correspondence with foreign nations

169
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,480
and make it public

170
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,280
it would surely ruin his reputation

171
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:26,160
and cost him everything

172
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:27,400
It's so late

173
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:29,560
What are they both doing in Zhu Huaichen's room?

174
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:30,520
Seventh Prince

175
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:32,640
What's wrong?

176
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:36,280
Nothing, just got burned

177
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:39,880
I wonder if Seventh Prince would mind

178
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:42,360
applying your special golden wound ointment for me

179
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:45,200
Go get it from Huamei. Where's the letter?

180
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:52,600
This is

181
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:55,000
Zhu Huaichen's correspondence with that Western Envoy

182
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:58,280
I've seen this feather at the Li residence before

183
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:01,920
Father said it was a captured artifact from the Western people

184
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:11,680
Why would Duan Yurou obey Zhu Huaijing's every command

185
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:15,040
and even hand over evidence of Zhu Huaichen's collusion with foreigners?

186
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:17,440
Could Duan Yurou be Zhu Huaijing's agent?

187
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:20,760
This might explain why when Mother Qin was killed

188
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:22,120
Duan Yurou didn't investigate at all

189
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:23,560
But that doesn't make sense

190
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:27,440
Zhu Huaijing suffered greatly under Duan Yurou's oppression in the past

191
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:29,360
What exactly is going on here?

192
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,280
In this lifetime

193
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:36,800
we must never allow Zhu Huaichen to ally with Western Yu and raise an army
